## Scope and constraints

The sole production delta is argument parsing. It does not touch entry, scoring, sizing, exit, portfolio,
provider, cache, dataset, or optimizer behavior. The handoff explicitly makes no return-improvement,
drawdown-reduction, parameter-selection, optimality, or optimization claim; it assigns later optimization
to the multi-agent backtest loop and keeps CANSLIM as the feature basis. It also records that no tests or
test files were added, formal regression tests remain deliberately deferred, and no dataset download,
network/provider access, cache refresh, backtest, optimizer, Git write, or sealed-artifact mutation occurred.

## Review constraints observed

Production and sealed reports were inspected read-only. Reported exact command/compile/diff evidence was
accepted without rerun. No production file, test, dataset, cache, artifact, or Git state was modified; only
this review artifact was created.
